          "id": "dcf790be972c8484a6553a95ed82779631d963dd",
          "message": "feat(benchmarks): capture CI artifacts and schedule agentic runs (#2387)\n\n* feat(benchmarks): capture versioned CI benchmark artifacts\n\nRecord random and AIPerf request evidence, resolved configuration, telemetry and reproducible metrics. Preserve legacy summaries and upload per-cell summary/full bundles before runner cleanup.\n\nProvide CPU-only validation, offline rebuild and InferenceX-compatible export. Keep visualization in AgenticViewer and consolidate producer logic into eight Python modules.\n\n* style(benchmarks): align artifact producer with CI checks\n\n* fix(benchmarks): defer server encoders for CPU client tests\n\n* fix(ci): integrate artifact tests with shared CPU suite\n\n* feat(ci): add scheduled and manual agentic benchmarks\n\n* feat(ci): separate agentic test and InferenceX nightly profiles\n\n* fix(ci): respect repository artifact retention limit\n\n* fix(ci): isolate CPU test package version from unrelated tags\n\n* fix(benchmarks): capture agentic identities and group workflow points\n\n* test(benchmarks): isolate Git ownership fixture from runner config\n\n* refactor(ci): separate agentic and random dispatch forms\n\n* refactor(ci): simplify agentic catalogs and revise nightly grid\n\n* fix(benchmarks): classify synthetic runs and pin replay execution",
